<view class="pageDemo"><mx-nav title="安全区" /><view style="height:{{navHeight}}px;"></view><view class="demoIntro"><desc type="name" text="SafeArea">SafeArea</desc><desc>刘海屏 / 底部指示条安全区域占位，用于全屏场景的顶部与底部适配</desc></view><wrap><title type="h2">顶部安全区</title><desc type="prop" text="position">position="top"</desc><view class="cons"><view class="preview"><mx-safe-area position="top" customStyle="background:#CA0E2D;" /><view class="previewBody">顶部红色区域为安全区占位</view></view></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">底部安全区</title><desc type="prop" text="position">position="bottom"</desc><view class="cons"><view class="preview"><view class="previewBody">底部红色区域为安全区占位</view><mx-safe-area position="bottom" customStyle="background:#CA0E2D;" /></view></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">顶部 + 底部</title><desc type="prop" text="position">position="both"</desc><view class="cons"><view class="preview"><mx-safe-area position="both" customStyle="background:#CA0E2D;" /></view><view class="tip">position="both" 会连续渲染顶部、底部两个占位节点。页面布局更推荐分别放置 top / bottom。无刘海 / 无底部指示条的设备上高度为 0，需真机查看。</view></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">页面布局示例</title><desc>顶部与底部分别放置 SafeArea，中间为滚动内容</desc><view class="cons"><view class="layoutDemo"><mx-safe-area position="top" customStyle="background:rgba(202,14,45,0.35);" /><view class="layoutList"><view class="layoutItem" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view></view><mx-safe-area position="bottom" customStyle="background:rgba(202,14,45,0.35);" /></view></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">自定义样式</title><desc type="prop" text="customStyle">customStyle</desc><view class="cons"><view class="preview"><view class="previewBody">可通过 customStyle 覆盖背景等样式</view><mx-safe-area position="bottom" customStyle="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#CA0E2D,#FF8F1F);" /></view></view></wrap><line /><prop-table dataSource="{{propDocs}}" /></view> 